        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11018-11039"><rb>海豚</rb><rt>いるか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11039-11042">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11042-11054"><rb>眼</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11054-11066"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11066-11077">よな、</seg></p>
