        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11148-11160"><rb>羽</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11160-11166">ぶり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11166-11178"><rb>羽</rb><rt>は</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11178-11201">ぶりおもしろ。</seg></p>
