        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11390-11408"><rb>菟狭</rb><rt>うさ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11408-11423">はよ、さす</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11423-11438"><rb>潮</rb><rt>しほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11438-11441">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11441-11465"><rb>水上</rb><rt>みなかみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11465-11470">、</seg></p>
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11470-11494"><rb>豊国</rb><rt>とよくに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11494-11497">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11497-11521"><rb>行宮</rb><rt>かりみや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11521-11526">。</seg></p>
