        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11632-11683"><rb>足一騰宮</rb><rt>あしひとつあがりのみや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11683-11689">は、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11689-11713"><rb>行宮</rb><rt>かりみや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11713-11718">と</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-11718-11736">青の岩根に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11736-11763"><rb>一柱</rb><rt>ひとはしら</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11763-11775"><rb>坐</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11775-11785">す。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11788-11839"><rb>足一騰宮</rb><rt>あしひとつあがりのみや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11839-11842">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11842-11863"><rb>参出</rb><rt>まゐづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11863-11874">ると、</seg></p>
