        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11935-11986"><rb>足一騰宮</rb><rt>あしひとつあがりのみや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11986-11989">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11989-12019"><rb>大御饗</rb><rt>おほみあへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12019-12024">、</seg></p>
