        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12192-12210"><rb>朝</rb><rt>あした</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12210-12225">さもらふ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12225-12243"><rb>夕</rb><rt>ゆふべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12243-12262">さもらふ。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12265-12316"><rb>足一騰宮</rb><rt>あしひとつあがりのみや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12316-12319">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12319-12334"><rb>湍</rb><rt>たぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12334-12337">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12337-12349"><rb>上</rb><rt>へ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12349-12357">や、</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-12357-12369">足一つ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12369-12384"><rb>騰</rb><rt>あが</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12384-12396">り、雲の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12396-12408"><rb>辺</rb><rt>べ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12408-12411">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12411-12423"><rb>坐</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12423-12433">す。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-12433-12468">ええしや、をしや、</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)"><seg source="#source-12468-12505">ええしや、をしや。</seg></p>
