        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22791-22815"><rb>厳橿</rb><rt>いつかし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22815-22821">や、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22821-22845"><rb>白檮</rb><rt>しらかし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22845-22851">や、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-22851-22884"><rb>処女檀</rb><rt>をとめまゆみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-22884-22889">、</seg></p>
