        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23688-23706"><rb>勢</rb><rt>きほひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23706-23715">無し、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23715-23730"><rb>臥</rb><rt>こや</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23730-23733">り</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23733-23748"><rb>撓</rb><rt>たわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23748-23759">むと、</seg></p>
