        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23800-23812"><rb>水</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23812-23815">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23815-23827"><rb>気</rb><rt>け</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23827-23836">尽き、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-23836-23863"><rb>素力</rb><rt>もとぢから</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-23863-23874">尽き、</seg></p>
