        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-61785-61832">西山荘　　　　　　　　　微笑</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-61832-61845">白樺</seg></p>
